{"fps": 30, "frames": 1666, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 133, "text": "The best stock market forecast ever found ran on butter.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "best", "f": 7, "e": 14}, {"w": "stock", "f": 16, "e": 25}, {"w": "market", "f": 27, "e": 34}, {"w": "forecast", "f": 37, "e": 50}, {"w": "ever", "f": 55, "e": 62}, {"w": "found", "f": 64, "e": 75}, {"w": "ran", "f": 85, "e": 91}, {"w": "on", "f": 94, "e": 96}, {"w": "butter.", "f": 101, "e": 122}]}, {"a": 133, "b": 215, "text": "Imagine a quant slides you one chart.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 135, "e": 146}, {"w": "a", "f": 147, "e": 149}, {"w": "quant", "f": 151, "e": 162}, {"w": "slides", "f": 165, "e": 174}, {"w": "you", "f": 176, "e": 178}, {"w": "one", "f": 181, "e": 185}, {"w": "chart.", "f": 187, "e": 199}]}, {"a": 215, "b": 371, "text": "Butter production in Bangladesh explained seventy-five percent of the stock market's moves.", "words": [{"w": "Butter", "f": 217, "e": 222}, {"w": "production", "f": 224, "e": 238}, {"w": "in", "f": 239, "e": 240}, {"w": "Bangladesh", "f": 242, "e": 263}, {"w": "explained", "f": 265, "e": 279}, {"w": "seventy-five", "f": 281, "e": 297}, {"w": "percent", "f": 302, "e": 313}, {"w": "of", "f": 315, "e": 317}, {"w": "the", "f": 318, "e": 320}, {"w": "stock", "f": 325, "e": 329}, {"w": "market's", "f": 334, "e": 341}, {"w": "moves.", "f": 346, "e": 354}]}, {"a": 371, "b": 473, "text": "Add American cheese, and the lines got even tighter.", "words": [{"w": "Add", "f": 373, "e": 377}, {"w": "American", "f": 383, "e": 389}, {"w": "cheese,", "f": 391, "e": 409}, {"w": "and", "f": 410, "e": 411}, {"w": "the", "f": 413, "e": 414}, {"w": "lines", "f": 416, "e": 425}, {"w": "got", "f": 429, "e": 432}, {"w": "even", "f": 434, "e": 441}, {"w": "tighter.", "f": 443, "e": 457}]}, {"a": 473, "b": 613, "text": "Then he threw in sheep, Bangladeshi and American, every last one.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 475, "e": 480}, {"w": "he", "f": 482, "e": 485}, {"w": "threw"